<title>UK: DG Hyp sets 100 mln mark structured four-year bond.</title>
<headline>DG Hyp sets 100 mln mark structured four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DG HYP</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    **	   MATURITY    12.JUN.01</p>
<p> TYPE   REV FLOATER   ISS PRICE  99.90     PAY DATE    11.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  10 BP     LISTING    HAMBURG   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC   5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     **8.40 PCT MINUS 12M DEM LIBOR, FIRST COUPON FIXED</p>
<p>		 AT 6.0 PCT</p>
<p>		 OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 770</p>
<p>- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
